  "text": "Rajasthan Tours - India | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 Domestic Rajasthan India Royal palaces, desert landscapes, and vibrant culture Why Visit Rajasthan? Rajasthan is the land of kings, featuring magnificent forts, opulent palaces, and the vast Thar Desert. Explore the pink city of Jaipur, the blue city of Jodhpur, and the romantic lake city of Udaipur. Experience desert safaris, camel rides, and stay in heritage hotels. The state&#x27;s colorful festivals, traditional cuisine, and folk music provide an immersive cultural experience. Best Time to Visit October to March Top Attractions Amber Fort, Jaipur City Palace, Udaipur Previous slide Next slide Amber Fort, Jaipur City Palace, Udaipur Mehrangarh Fort, Jodhpur Jaisalmer Fort Pushkar Lake Ranthambore National Park Activities & Experiences Desert Safari Camel Rides Palace Tours Cultural Shows Hot Air Ballooning Shopping in Bazaars Plan Your Trip Enquire Now WhatsApp Us Contact Information Phone +91 63618 77187 Email showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
